==History==
2016
*The Musketeer [[Cards|card]] was added with [[Version History#Softlaunch on iOS (4/1/2016)|Clash Royale's game launch]] on 4/1/2016.
*On 9/2/2016, the [[Version History#Chest Rewards & Card Balance (9/2/2016)|Chest Rewards & Card Balance Update]] decreased the Musketeer's Damage by 25% and her Cost to 4 [[Elixir]] (from 5).
*On 19/2/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (19/2/2016)|Balance Update]] increased the Musketeer's Damage by 11%.
*On 29/2/2016, the [[Version History#March 2016 Update (29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]], decreased the Musketeer's Sight Range to 6 tiles (from 6.5 tiles). It also changed the Musketeer's card image.
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]] increased the {{Rarity|Rare}} card Level Cap to 11 (from 10). The update also fixed the “range bug”, by decreasing the Musketeer's Range to 6 tiles (from 6.5 tiles), but maintaining her effective Range.
2018
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September 2018 Update (5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]] made {{Rarity|Rare}} cards start at Level 3 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 11).
2019
*On 4/2/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/2/2019)|Balance Update]] increased the Musketeer's Damage by 3%.
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End of November 2019 Update (26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]] added a card render to the Musketeer's card info screen.
2020
*On 6/10/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2020)|Balance Update]] increased the Musketeer's First Attack Period to 0.8 seconds (from 0.5 seconds).
2021
*On 2/9/2021, a maintenance break, changed the Musketeer's card render.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions Update (27/10/2021)|Champions Update]] increased the Level Cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 3/2/2022, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/2/2022)|Balance Update]] decreased the Musketeer's Attack Period to 1 second (from 1.1 seconds).
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card Evolution Update (19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]]  increased the Level Cap of all cards to 15 (from 14). It also added the No Escape [[Card Mastery]] task for the Musketeer.
2024
*On 4/11/2024, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (4/11/2024)|November 2024 Update]] allowed the Musketeer to [[Card Evolution|Evolve]].
2025
*On 4/2/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/2/2025)|Balance Update]] decreased the Musketeer's First Attack Period to 0.7 seconds (from 0.8 seconds).
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]] decreased the Musketeer's Damage by 0.45% and her Hitpoints by 0.06%.
*On 29/10/2025, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (29/10/2025)|maintenance break]] changed the Musketeer's card image.
*On 24/11/2025, the [[Version History#Level 16 Update (24/11/2025)|Level 16 Update]] increased the Level Cap of all cards to 16 (from 15).
*On 1/12/2025, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (1/12/2025)|December 2025 Update]] added the Musketeer's [[Heroes|Hero]] form.

